<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 572.57, down 3.49.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 345 to 209.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,720,615, compared with 20,007,525 Friday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
